00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:01.833
- Duolingo, I don't need
to know if this is a pen.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:04.890
I know what an Apple is.

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:05.797
I don't have to ask what an apple is.

00:21:05.797 --> 00:21:07.495
- You know, there's some good stuff there.

00:21:07.495 --> 00:21:08.328
I'm not saying it's all bad,

00:21:08.328 --> 00:21:10.410
but I just felt the structure
was all over the place.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.870
- Yeah, because I remember.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:12.703
When we first moved...

00:21:12.703 --> 00:21:13.536
Before we moved to Japan

00:21:13.536 --> 00:21:16.270
Me and Connor were on
