00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:17.590
Month and a half.

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:18.940
Before moving to Japan.

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:20.180
And then we got here,

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.350
and we were "Oh, we don't know shit."

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:25.327
