00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:57.038
I'm, "Bruh."

00:21:57.038 --> 00:21:57.871
(all laughing)

00:21:57.871 --> 00:21:59.180
- I can read.

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:00.013
- Hurrah moment.

00:22:00.013 --> 00:22:00.846
- It was crazy.

00:22:00.846 --> 00:22:02.180
Like I said earlier, when you go outside,

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:03.380
and you've unlocked the world.

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:05.900
Cause you can start suddenly
reading McDonald's menus

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:06.733
with no.

00:22:06.733 --> 00:22:08.310
- Is the pneumonics thing where you.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.280
It's shape based.

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:11.113
- Yeah.

00:22:11.113 --> 00:22:11.946
- Yeah.

00:22:11.946 --> 00:22:13.000
- It would make you assign...

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:15.530
And to be fair, this is how
memory champions, memorize stuff

00:22:15.530 --> 00:22:20.350
they assign stories and shapes
and objects to the memory.

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:21.850
And that way they can
recall them much easier.

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:24.220
So it would say [indistinct]
which is the one

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:25.053
that's like that.

00:22:25.053 --> 00:22:26.392
