see this symbol for cooking.

00:22:29.010 --> 00:22:30.926
- [indistinct] Look like a chef's hat.

00:22:30.926 --> 00:22:34.009
(indistinct chatter)

00:22:34.884 --> 00:22:36.382
It was yeah, it was a sign.

00:22:36.382 --> 00:22:38.360
Because then you remember
that's kind of dumb

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:39.193
that it's telling you to do that.

00:22:39.193 --> 00:22:40.400
But then you remember when you see it.

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:41.480
Oh, it's that dumb thing.

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:42.313
- Yeah.

00:22:42.313 --> 00:22:43.180
- You remember the dumb shit.

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:44.930
- Yeah, I mean, it's really stupid,

00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:46.520
but it made you remember it.

00:22:46.520 --> 00:22:48.320
- It's Counter-intuitive right.

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:51.090
Because by remembering more stuff

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:52.870
you remember one stuff better

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:55.128
as opposed to just repeating
the same thing over and over.

00:22:55.128 --> 00:22:58.010
But the best way I've
heard an explanation for it

00:22:58.010 --> 00:23:01.920
is that your memory is kind
of a filing cabinet, right?

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:04.760
So if you just have one
random piece of information

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:06.710
that you just randomly file.

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:08.390
It's very hard to just find

00:23:08.390 --> 00:23:09.590
that random piece of information.

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:10.423
But you have...

00:23:10.423 --> 00:23:12.790
If that information is got a bunch

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:14.700
of other information that relates to that,

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:17.350
then it's much easier for you
to find it in your memory.

00:23:17.350 --> 00:23:20.224
So that's why you can just
recall things a lot easier.

00:23:20.224 --> 00:23:21.650
- Yeah.

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:22.490
- Yeah.

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:24.320
- I definitely feel that.

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:26.350
I find that learning symbols for me

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:30.500
