- Sorry to bring a downer to this episode.

01:14:36.200 --> 01:14:38.169
People even watch less.

01:14:38.169 --> 01:14:41.290
(indistinct chatter)

01:14:41.290 --> 01:14:42.530
- But bottom line is that, you know,

01:14:42.530 --> 01:14:45.200
regardless of the that we did talk about

01:14:45.200 --> 01:14:49.050
a lot of light depressing
pieces of literature and media,

01:14:49.050 --> 01:14:50.520
just because it puts you down

01:14:50.520 --> 01:14:51.613
at the end of the day, it doesn't mean

01:14:51.613 --> 01:14:52.847
it's something that
people should skip over.

01:14:52.847 --> 01:14:55.100
I think that it's equally as important

01:14:55.100 --> 01:14:57.910
to experience those kinds
of anime and literature.

01:14:57.910 --> 01:15:00.850
- I like to do that,
so that I'm comfortable

01:15:00.850 --> 01:15:03.050
with having those
emotions pop up sometimes.

01:15:04.520 --> 01:15:06.720
I feel like I have at
least some experience

01:15:06.720 --> 01:15:07.940
dealing with them.

01:15:07.940 --> 01:15:09.820
Maybe when someone
else's it's a lot easier.

01:15:09.820 --> 01:15:11.560
But if you do get to
that point where you are

01:15:11.560 --> 01:15:12.787
starting to feel that, it's like,

01:15:12.787 --> 01:15:15.740
"Okay I kind of understand
where this is coming from."

01:15:15.740 --> 01:15:17.390
Maybe I know better how to process it.

01:15:17.390 --> 01:15:19.500
- Yeah, a questions for you
guys going off this then

01:15:19.500 --> 01:15:21.350
but it's a bit less depressing.

01:15:21.350 --> 01:15:24.160
Has there been any shows or any anime

01:15:25.347 --> 01:15:27.790
in your history that has
affected you in any way?

01:15:27.790 --> 01:15:30.480
Not just in the negative
aspects obviously,

01:15:30.480 --> 01:15:32.030
or just rethinking life, but just-

01:15:32.030 --> 01:15:33.309
- Black Butler-

01:15:33.309 --> 01:15:34.969
(all laugh)

01:15:34.969 --> 01:15:37.383
- You definitely has a
rethink life after that one.

01:15:38.610 --> 01:15:43.270
- I think for me, as much
as I hate to use the word

01:15:43.270 --> 01:15:44.740
changed my life.

01:15:44.740 --> 01:15:47.852
For me was, and this is
gonna sound cliche as fuck,

01:15:47.852 --> 01:15:49.007
but Clannad was one of them.

01:15:49.007 --> 01:15:50.730
(Connor and Garnt laugh)

01:15:50.730 --> 01:15:53.393
- I know, I totally understand

01:15:53.393 --> 01:15:55.180
where that laughter comes from.

01:15:55.180 --> 01:15:57.220
I'm sure there was a handful of people

01:15:57.220 --> 01:15:58.930
who laughed at the same time.

01:15:58.930 --> 01:16:01.033
Because it's so cliche
now, to say that Clannad

01:16:01.033 --> 01:16:02.490
changed your life.

01:16:02.490 --> 01:16:05.122
When I watched that all the way through,

01:16:05.122 --> 01:16:06.133
it straight up.

01:16:06.133 --> 01:16:07.950
- That after story fucked me up.

01:16:07.950 --> 01:16:10.680
- That was the first time that I,

01:16:10.680 --> 01:16:13.930
not just in anime, but
in any piece of media

01:16:13.930 --> 01:16:16.480
that I just fucking broke down crying.

01:16:16.480 --> 01:16:19.440
Because especially that second
half of Clannad After Story.

01:16:19.440 --> 01:16:24.030
It was just the most brutal
pain to the longest buildup.

01:16:24.030 --> 01:16:26.240
And just, I don't think I'll be able to...

01:16:26.240 --> 01:16:28.350
That's again going back million topics.

01:16:28.350 --> 01:16:29.730
That's another show I
don't think I'll be able

01:16:29.730 --> 01:16:31.030
to watch again.

01:16:31.030 --> 01:16:33.010
Just because again, I'm
not in that head space,

01:16:33.010 --> 01:16:33.843
and it's just something.

01:16:33.843 --> 01:16:36.740
It's not just the fact that
it was just a sad anime,

01:16:36.740 --> 01:16:38.830
but I think it's just the fact that

01:16:38.830 --> 01:16:42.610
again you've been kind of
following these characters lives

01:16:42.610 --> 01:16:43.480
all the way through.

01:16:43.480 --> 01:16:48.410
Whereas visual novels or
romance stories would end

01:16:48.410 --> 01:16:50.240
with the couple getting together.

01:16:50.240 --> 01:16:52.120
Clannad took that one step further

01:16:52.120 --> 01:16:55.790
and showed you as the
title says the after story.

01:16:55.790 --> 01:16:56.623
Of what happens.

01:16:56.623 --> 01:16:59.370
And I think just seeing
that made these characters

01:16:59.370 --> 01:17:00.980
even more relatable to me.

01:17:00.980 --> 01:17:02.133
That was the first time where I was like,

01:17:02.133 --> 01:17:05.530
"You know what family is cool, man.

01:17:05.530 --> 01:17:06.870
Family is fucking dope."

01:17:06.870 --> 01:17:09.506
Before that family was just a thing you-

01:17:09.506 --> 01:17:10.649
- Just a Christian matter of-

01:17:10.649 --> 01:17:11.700
(indistinct chatter)

01:17:11.700 --> 01:17:15.160
- Because before you know,
the concept of family

01:17:15.160 --> 01:17:17.260
was just very much everybody else.

01:17:17.260 --> 01:17:18.900
Where it's like, of course family's cool.

01:17:18.900 --> 01:17:19.920
Yeah, everyone wants a family.

01:17:19.920 --> 01:17:23.490
But Clannad was that one
show that really dug into

01:17:23.490 --> 01:17:25.740
just how important family is.

01:17:25.740 --> 01:17:28.880
And I think that, I mean,
as weird as it is to say

01:17:28.880 --> 01:17:32.750
after I watched Clannad, I
became way close to my family.

01:17:32.750 --> 01:17:34.376
And I think that's a big aspect

01:17:34.376 --> 01:17:35.709
- That's pretty wholesome.

01:17:35.709 --> 01:17:36.580
- It is wholesome.

01:17:36.580 --> 01:17:38.210
And that really changed my life.

01:17:38.210 --> 01:17:39.680
- I feel really bad now.

01:17:39.680 --> 01:17:40.798
- Why?

01:17:40.798 --> 01:17:42.130
- Because you're talking about
how can I change your life?

01:17:42.130 --> 01:17:44.309
I couldn't fucking
finish the first season.

01:17:44.309 --> 01:17:45.709
(Joey and Garnt laugh)

01:17:45.709 --> 01:17:46.553
- That's no problem.

01:17:46.553 --> 01:17:49.980
- I've watched Clannad and After Story.

01:17:49.980 --> 01:17:51.587
The whole time when I was
watching Clannad, I'm like,

01:17:51.587 --> 01:17:52.987
"When is it gonna get good?"

01:17:54.150 --> 01:17:57.447
Don't fucking sing that Dango
song one more time bitch.

01:17:57.447 --> 01:17:59.180
I dare you to sing that song one more-

01:17:59.180 --> 01:18:02.190
- Cause I remember watching
the first eight episodes

01:18:02.190 --> 01:18:04.930
and I'm just like, man
this is trying really hard.

01:18:04.930 --> 01:18:07.770
- It's so fucking boring.

01:18:07.770 --> 01:18:09.020
- But that's the problem.

01:18:10.180 --> 01:18:12.450
Is that the thing with the
first season of Clannad.

01:18:12.450 --> 01:18:14.727
I never say to people,

01:18:14.727 --> 01:18:16.200
"Hey, you should watch the
first season of Clannad.

01:18:16.200 --> 01:18:19.800
Because I know that on
the grand scale of things,

01:18:19.800 --> 01:18:21.254
the first season is fucking boring.

01:18:21.254 --> 01:18:22.980
- You can't appreciate the second season.

01:18:22.980 --> 01:18:23.813
- That's the problem.

01:18:23.813 --> 01:18:25.040
You can't jump into After Story

01:18:25.040 --> 01:18:27.713
without having experienced
these characters.

01:18:27.713 --> 01:18:29.050
And it is important.

01:18:29.050 --> 01:18:30.680
Because a lot of these characters

01:18:30.680 --> 01:18:33.870
do make a very significant
impact in After Story.

01:18:33.870 --> 01:18:36.200
- But I guess, you know, it's really hard

01:18:36.200 --> 01:18:37.442
I guess, especially now.

01:18:37.442 --> 01:18:40.411
Maybe back then you could
make someone watch 25 episodes

01:18:40.411 --> 01:18:42.480
of bullshit to get a good pay off.

01:18:42.480 --> 01:18:43.735
But now you can't do that.

01:18:43.735 --> 01:18:45.860
I just don't think you
can recommend anymore.

01:18:45.860 --> 01:18:48.050
- Right, because the story structure

01:18:48.050 --> 01:18:50.770
and the joke structures that pop in.

01:18:50.770 --> 01:18:52.350
It's just so overdone now.

01:18:52.350 --> 01:18:55.110
That it just seems like an aged version

01:18:55.110 --> 01:18:56.640
of everything that you can see today.

01:18:56.640 --> 01:19:00.433
But back when Clannad first
came out in 2009, I believe.

01:19:00.433 --> 01:19:01.266
- Yeah, it was about 2007, 2009.

01:19:01.266 --> 01:19:02.997
I think I watched it, after
I watched Haruhi Suzumiya

01:19:02.997 --> 01:19:05.637
the first season.

01:19:05.637 --> 01:19:07.074
And I remember thinking,

01:19:07.074 --> 01:19:08.657
"This is just shittier in every way."

01:19:08.657 --> 01:19:10.640
(Joey and Garnt laugh)

01:19:10.640 --> 01:19:13.135
The school dynamic was just garbage.

01:19:13.135 --> 01:19:14.870
- Do you just watch every high
school anime, and just like

01:19:14.870 --> 01:19:16.320
yeah, it's in high school.

01:19:16.320 --> 01:19:17.535
It's the same show.

01:19:17.535 --> 01:19:18.627
- This must be good.

01:19:18.627 --> 01:19:20.775
- I like to compare the high school anime

01:19:20.775 --> 01:19:22.635
and see what dynamics they got going on,

01:19:22.635 --> 01:19:23.510
and see what I'm enjoying.

01:19:23.510 --> 01:19:25.460
Their uniform is different than before.

01:19:27.226 --> 01:19:28.976
- This was a model in their school.

01:19:29.820 --> 01:19:30.740
- Going off topic.

01:19:30.740 --> 01:19:33.290
I remember the first time
I watched Seraph The End.

01:19:33.290 --> 01:19:35.080
And I remember it was a it was a show

01:19:35.080 --> 01:19:37.170
with a post-apocalyptic show,

01:19:37.170 --> 01:19:39.820
about how vampires had
taken over the world.

01:19:39.820 --> 01:19:42.490
And then for like four episodes in

01:19:42.490 --> 01:19:44.010
there's just a fucking high school.

01:19:44.010 --> 01:19:46.310
And I'm like, "Why is
there a high school?"

01:19:46.310 --> 01:19:49.570
If there's one show that doesn't
need a high school dynamic,

01:19:49.570 --> 01:19:50.780
it's fucking this show.

01:19:50.780 --> 01:19:51.980
- I'm guilty.

01:19:51.980 --> 01:19:54.710
Cause I'm the only guy
I think who has read

01:19:54.710 --> 01:19:56.213
all of that manga so far.

01:19:57.080 --> 01:19:58.330
- I'm the complete opposite of guilty.

01:19:58.330 --> 01:20:00.930
I never consumed anything about it.

01:20:00.930 --> 01:20:03.705
Which is so weird because
for the longest time

01:20:03.705 --> 01:20:05.262
I don't know if you
guys got these messages.

01:20:05.262 --> 01:20:07.859
So many people were asking to make a video

01:20:07.859 --> 01:20:08.692
on Seraph of The End.

01:20:08.692 --> 01:20:10.163
- It's got a really big female following.

01:20:10.163 --> 01:20:10.996
- Yeah.

01:20:10.996 --> 01:20:11.829
- Have you noticed I
don't think there's been

01:20:11.829 --> 01:20:13.850
a single AniTuber that
has made a video on it.

01:20:13.850 --> 01:20:15.129
- Because they're all dudes.

01:20:15.129 --> 01:20:16.712
(Joey and Garnt laugh)

01:20:16.712 --> 01:20:19.772
- Not even the few females
we have in the [indistinct]

01:20:19.772 --> 01:20:20.605
community have made it.

01:20:20.605 --> 01:20:21.470
- The first episode of Zeraph of The End

01:20:21.470 --> 01:20:23.730
was one of the best first episodes of,

01:20:23.730 --> 01:20:25.007
I remember for a while that we had had.

01:20:25.007 --> 01:20:27.060
It was such a good first episode.

01:20:27.060 --> 01:20:28.920
- No, it was really good.

01:20:28.920 --> 01:20:30.490
- World ending Wars.

01:20:30.490 --> 01:20:32.195
And then like you said, high school.

01:20:32.195 --> 01:20:35.410
(Joey and Garnt laugh)

01:20:35.410 --> 01:20:36.810
- It gets really good again,

01:20:36.810 --> 01:20:38.437
when they leave high school.

01:20:38.437 --> 01:20:39.593
- It does.

01:20:39.593 --> 01:20:40.500
- They quickly abandon that.

01:20:40.500 --> 01:20:43.097
- And I'd to think that's
the author being like,

01:20:43.097 --> 01:20:44.413
"Yeah, this is...

01:20:44.413 --> 01:20:46.097
- Shit go back.

01:20:46.097 --> 01:20:47.750
- It got really good.

01:20:47.750 --> 01:20:50.313
And I'd say about two
thirds through the manga.

01:20:50.313 --> 01:20:51.700
Because it hasn't finished yet.

01:20:51.700 --> 01:20:52.896
But about two-thirds through the manga.

01:20:52.896 --> 01:20:54.350
Where it is right now, it gets amazing.

01:20:54.350 --> 01:20:55.183
- Yeah.

01:20:55.183 --> 01:20:57.320
- And then it goes not so good.

01:20:57.320 --> 01:20:58.153
- Yeah.

01:20:58.153 --> 01:20:59.770
Cause did the manga
deviate from the anime?

01:20:59.770 --> 01:21:01.510
Cause I remember watching All of The Anime

01:21:01.510 --> 01:21:04.110
and it was one of those shows where

01:21:04.110 --> 01:21:05.600
I had a good time watching it.

01:21:05.600 --> 01:21:06.920
- If I remember correctly, the manga

01:21:06.920 --> 01:21:09.110
was really really similar to the show.

01:21:09.110 --> 01:21:11.070
And they build on a lot of the things

01:21:11.070 --> 01:21:12.990
that I thought were really
interesting in the show

01:21:12.990 --> 01:21:15.433
amazingly in the manga as it goes on.

01:21:16.710 --> 01:21:19.920
But then it became really weird

01:21:19.920 --> 01:21:23.173
and world ending plot kind of trigger E.

01:21:25.430 --> 01:21:28.120
I don't really like the final villain

01:21:28.120 --> 01:21:29.200
that they have as well.

01:21:29.200 --> 01:21:31.460
It's just a fine, it's fine.

01:21:31.460 --> 01:21:32.927
- It's one of those shows where I'm like

01:21:32.927 --> 01:21:34.420
"I had a good time watching it.

01:21:34.420 --> 01:21:35.580
I'm not going to re watch it.

01:21:35.580 --> 01:21:36.945
I'm probably not gonna remember

01:21:36.945 --> 01:21:37.798
most of the stuff that happens."

01:21:37.798 --> 01:21:39.130
- Would you recommend people
to read it or watch it?

01:21:39.130 --> 01:21:40.923
Because I haven't done either.

01:21:41.920 --> 01:21:45.050
- I would say watch it and
if you what you've watched

01:21:45.050 --> 01:21:47.020
then continue onwards.

01:21:47.020 --> 01:21:48.700
You'll going to probably enjoy it I think

01:21:48.700 --> 01:21:51.970
up to a certain point and then
you'll start to be confused

01:21:51.970 --> 01:21:54.230
and, it's good though.

01:21:54.230 --> 01:21:55.063
It's good.

01:21:55.063 --> 01:21:56.915
I like how they did a lot of things.

01:21:56.915 --> 01:21:58.080
Sounds like the most Trump sentence ever.

01:21:58.080 --> 01:21:59.370
I like how they did things.

01:21:59.370 --> 01:22:00.698
(Garnt laughs)

01:22:00.698 --> 01:22:01.903
- It means a lot to me.

01:22:01.903 --> 01:22:04.316
- They did things, I
like the things I did.

01:22:04.316 --> 01:22:06.550
(all laugh)

01:22:06.550 --> 01:22:07.610
- I totally get it though.

01:22:07.610 --> 01:22:09.976
Cause I actually agree with you.

01:22:09.976 --> 01:22:11.572
It was good.

01:22:11.572 --> 01:22:12.731
I had a good time.

01:22:12.731 --> 01:22:15.433
- It's like the most 6 out of 10 ever.

01:22:16.722 --> 01:22:20.510
It's very decent and I
have minimal complaints.

01:22:20.510 --> 01:22:21.661
There's not much to it.

01:22:21.661 --> 01:22:22.950
And you're just kind of like, I'm happy.

01:22:22.950 --> 01:22:23.920
I'm happy with what happened.

01:22:23.920 --> 01:22:25.090
And I don't want an more.

01:22:25.090 --> 01:22:29.890
It was before I had five
Isekai to watch every season

01:22:29.890 --> 01:22:31.710
and this just took the space of that.

01:22:31.710 --> 01:22:33.410
- This came right after the hyper

01:22:33.410 --> 01:22:35.302
season one of Attack of Titan.

01:22:35.302 --> 01:22:38.210
I remember everyone was
hyped as fuck for this app.

01:22:38.210 --> 01:22:40.100
And then it kinda fell off.

01:22:40.100 --> 01:22:41.360
Even though I thought the anime

01:22:41.360 --> 01:22:42.920
was pretty fucking hype.

01:22:42.920 --> 01:22:43.840
- It just kind of just...

01:22:43.840 --> 01:22:44.673
It just didn't take off.

01:22:44.673 --> 01:22:46.097
And I don't know why.

01:22:46.097 --> 01:22:47.790
- It's weird as hell because the anime

01:22:47.790 --> 01:22:50.493
had an amazing fight scene.

01:22:52.170 --> 01:22:53.670
An orchestrated, fight.

01:22:53.670 --> 01:22:55.160
They were hunting down these vampires.

01:22:55.160 --> 01:22:56.530
Really cool episode.

01:22:56.530 --> 01:22:58.143
And for some reason
that wasn't enough hype.

01:22:58.143 --> 01:22:59.470
- It's one of those shows that weirdly

01:22:59.470 --> 01:23:02.630
I hear some people still talk about

01:23:02.630 --> 01:23:05.330
but I don't really see anything about.

01:23:05.330 --> 01:23:06.170
You know what I mean?

01:23:06.170 --> 01:23:07.570
- Cause I think people who read it

01:23:07.570 --> 01:23:09.570
are really, really into it.

01:23:09.570 --> 01:23:10.598
It's good.

01:23:10.598 --> 01:23:11.453
- I think the problem with it

01:23:11.453 --> 01:23:13.960
is that I just kind of
liked its own identity

01:23:13.960 --> 01:23:14.840
when it first aired.

01:23:14.840 --> 01:23:15.890
Because I remember when it first aired

01:23:15.890 --> 01:23:17.627
I think I made a joke that I was like,

01:23:17.627 --> 01:23:21.173
"Oh it's Attack on Blue
Exorcist with gay vampires."

01:23:21.173 --> 01:23:22.369
Or something along that line.

01:23:22.369 --> 01:23:23.420
- It very much is an amalgamation

01:23:23.420 --> 01:23:24.660
of a lot of different aspects.

01:23:24.660 --> 01:23:27.550
And the main character
is kind of annoying.

01:23:27.550 --> 01:23:28.383
- Yeah.

01:23:28.383 --> 01:23:29.216
That's true as well.

01:23:29.216 --> 01:23:31.200
- That's never a good sign.

01:23:31.200 --> 01:23:34.497
It's annoying cause it's
like I like all of this,

01:23:34.497 --> 01:23:36.333
but we're getting a lot of this one thing

01:23:36.333 --> 01:23:38.200
that I'm just kind of wish it would

01:23:38.200 --> 01:23:40.733
just be a little less potent, you know?

01:23:42.623 --> 01:23:44.230
There's a lot of shows like that though.

01:23:44.230 --> 01:23:45.520
I've read the manga after it

01:23:45.520 --> 01:23:47.290
and no one really spoke about it.

01:23:47.290 --> 01:23:48.397
And I was like, "I don't
really know why I like this."

01:23:48.397 --> 01:23:50.531
- Like a certain Black Clover.

01:23:50.531 --> 01:23:51.651
- I didn't read Black Clover.

01:23:51.651 --> 01:23:53.321
- Hey man, Black Clover is good.

01:23:53.321 --> 01:23:54.586
I'm repping Black Clover man.

01:23:54.586 --> 01:23:55.635
- Shit, I shouldn't have said that.

01:23:55.635 --> 01:23:58.691
He's gonna go off for 40 minutes about it.

01:23:58.691 --> 01:24:00.341
- My monkey brain is taking over now.

01:24:00.341 --> 01:24:01.430
(Joey and Garnt laugh)

01:24:01.430 --> 01:24:02.300
- Black Clover, Black Clover.

01:24:02.300 --> 01:24:03.133
- Black Clover.

01:24:03.133 --> 01:24:03.990
- For some reason, I
always ended up reading

01:24:03.990 --> 01:24:05.650
the manga that no one fucking talks about

